Case spec:
{
  "set": "extraction",
  "persona": {
    "country": "NG",
    "trade": "brass home decor",
    "offering": "goods",
    "currency": "EUR"
  },
  "hinglish": false,
  "injection_in_buyer_chat": false,
  "documents": [
    {
      "kind": "communication",
      "write": "buyer-seller chat agreeing the order"
    },
    {
      "kind": "invoice",
      "write": "the seller's invoice"
    },
    {
      "kind": "shipment",
      "write": "the shipping receipt or courier booking"
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "amount"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "deliverable"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "date"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "party"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "unverifiable",
      "field": "tracking_number"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "carrier"
    }
  ]
}
Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat",
      "text": "14 May, 09:10 — Mara: Hello, can you make two hammered brass candleholders for me?\n14 May, 09:14 — Teni: Yes. Each will be about 18 cm tall, with a matte finish. I sell them as a matching pair.\n14 May, 09:18 — Mara: That sounds good. What is the total to send them to me in Portugal?\n14 May, 09:22 — Teni: EUR 96 for the pair and EUR 24 shipping, so EUR 120 in total.\n14 May, 09:25 — Mara: Agreed. Please send the invoice; I’ll pay through PayPal.\n14 May, 09:28 — Teni: Thank you. I’ll pack both in one parcel and send them from Nigeria."
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller invoice",
      "text": "INVOICE\nIssued: 14 May 2025\nSeller: Teni Afolu, brass home decor maker, Nigeria\nBuyer: Mara Veldin, Portugal\n\nHammered brass candleholders, matte finish, 18 cm tall\nQuantity: 2\nPrice for pair: EUR 96\nShipping: EUR 24\nTotal due: EUR 120\n\nPayment method: PayPal\nThe two candleholders will be packed together in one parcel. The quoted shipping charge covers standard packing and dispatch from Nigeria to Portugal. Please check the finish and quantity above before payment. The seller will arrange collection after payment is received."
    },
    {
      "title": "Courier booking",
      "text": "COURIER BOOKING\nCarrier: DHL Express\nBooking date: 16 May 2025\nSender: Teni Afolu, Nigeria\nRecipient: Mara Veldin, Portugal\n\nContents: two brass candleholders\nParcels: 1\nService: international delivery\nShipping charge: EUR 24\nCollection: requested for 17 May 2025\n\nThe sender is responsible for securing the contents inside the parcel before collection. A tracking reference will be issued separately when the parcel is accepted by the courier; it is not included on this booking confirmation. Keep this confirmation with the invoice for the shipment details."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: EUR 120",
      "value": "EUR 120"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: two hammered brass candleholders",
      "value": "two hammered brass candleholders"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 14 May 2025",
      "value": "14 May 2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Teni Afolu",
      "value": "Teni Afolu"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tracking number: tracking number of the parcel",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Carrier: DHL Express",
      "value": "DHL Express"
    }
  ]
}
